{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35434","headline":"送羽人王锡归罗浮 · 曹唐","name":"送羽人王锡归罗浮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风前整顿紫荷巾，常向罗浮保养神。\n石磴倚天行带月，铁桥通海入无尘。\n龙蛇出洞闲邀雨，犀象眠花不避人。\n最爱葛洪寻药处，露苗烟蕊满山春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹唐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35434.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35434","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}